{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Ready to become the top student and take home the $500,000 prize?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2404390/extras/52d194795e8aeec64f524af640ab2dbe.poster.avif?t=1767531102\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2404390/extras/52d194795e8aeec64f524af640ab2dbe.webm?t=1767531102\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83c\udf93 The Concept</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freshly arrived in the United States for a semester in Economics and Marketing, you\u2019re thrown into a one-of-a-kind competition: the <strong>B.E.S.T.</strong><br>100 participants. $500,000 on the line. Only one winner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s up to you to build alliances, seduce your partners, and decide who deserves your trust\u2026 and who deserves betrayal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2404390/extras/a3a0a1fdc15a2c7695b531faf2b3b64a.poster.avif?t=1767531102\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2404390/extras/a3a0a1fdc15a2c7695b531faf2b3b64a.webm?t=1767531102\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83d\udc94 Romance, Seduction, and Rivalries</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: c